  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b2fac0ff8688b8c2756cb12eb50db6f9ab77ab602dc9288529902170b33860a5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:10 P.M.    天气/晴\n企鹅物流据点，糟糕的室内"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "这里就是企鹅物流的据点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（好乱，而且好暗。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "只是我们的据点之一，没怎么好好收拾，随意坐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊，谢谢......我好像还没有正式向你们道谢，企鹅物流的各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "只是工作，先做个自我介绍好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——信使，代号拜松，来自龙门峯驰物流，受家父指教，前来贵司参观学习，请多关照。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "关于我与大帝先生的合同内容，虽然之前已经确认过了，但还是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "慢着，我有个小问题，你那五大三粗的爹是怎么把你养得这么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......老板。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "好，好，你继续。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "咳，关于刚才的袭击，无疑是对峯驰物流和企鹅物流的挑衅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "这件事情绝不能轻视，如果有必要的话，我会通知家父和近卫局，此事应当被视作一起恶性袭击——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喂，德克萨斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "晚上吃什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "欢迎派对！还用问吗？但是空去哪儿了，不是留下看家了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "反正只要德克萨斯联系她的话，她立刻就能赶回来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，你接着说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（空？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......咳，当务之急是调查那些袭击我们的敌人，企鹅物流的各位有什么头绪吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "头绪？不就是普通的业务纠纷吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃，业务纠纷......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "德克萨斯！我抽屉里的雪茄呢！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "老板，我们已经好久没回过这个据点了，恐怕早就发霉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "空来打扫过，可能那时候扔掉了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，那我今天晚上会死的，不行，这可不行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，你继续，别在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "首先我们应该明确敌人的目的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "慢着，音乐！我的黑胶唱片！是不是放了一箱在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "啊，好像是我搬来的。那一箱得有我好几个月薪水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "在这儿，要听哪张？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "随便哪张都行，被我选中的只会是宇宙末日级精品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，音乐，有了艺术的人生才不会无聊，赞美音乐，以及我自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "拜松，接着说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......我、我说到哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "他们的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "对！他们的目的应该是我，也许，是为了挑拨贵司与我司的关系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "什么啊，这点小事，还以为只是给之前的事情报仇......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "您有什么线索吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "——咳咳！德克萨斯！去调查一下他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "加班费，三倍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "唔，这种程度的打架每个月都会有个十七八次啦。信使不都是这样工作的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "信使不是应该更加隐秘一点，迅速一点......从来不是以武力为标准的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "是这样的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......我们明明是个物流公司，为什么总是被卷进帮派斗争里去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "因为他们的品味太低，对自己生而为人的品位太低。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "也因为老板发我们薪水嘛。不过还是有在遵纪守法地运送货物啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "只是大部分时候都会变成武装运送而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "对嘛，这有什么问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......？这真的没问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "先等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "这里，是空留下的密码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "饼、饼干？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，干嘛要打开了放在这里，受潮了就不好吃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "有巧克力的一面是长，尾巴是短，这是密码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（这是什么独特的密码学......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "什么？那时候是当真的吗？不是玩笑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......我只是普通地记下了空的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "“可疑分子”，唔，空可能追出去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "随她去吧，已经到下班时间了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "今天可是安魂夜，没有加班，没有资本主义的压迫，否则死人都难安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "晚上谁想去喝一杯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "啊，莫非老板请客？上次才进了一批价格不菲的藏酒~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "完全没问题，反正你们几个有大把的薪水可以扣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "那算了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "等等！那个......我们没有什么对策吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "就放任这些黑手党？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "走一步看一步呗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......龙门近卫局不会介入吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "大概不会吧 ，他们应该都习惯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "既来之则安之。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "但上个月发来的公物损害赔偿清单有点长，各自都稍微注意一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......那，平时的工作呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "按照委托送货，然后打架。如果要打架的话，打架优先。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "顺便一提，任何委托只过老板一手，至于谁来做，谁能抢到就算谁的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喂，叫拜松的小子，你爹把你托付给我们，哪怕只是暂时的，你也是企鹅物流的一员了，明白吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——明白，呃，大概吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "那么你就必须记住，企鹅物流员工须知的第一条重要规定，那就是：“不拘小节”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "昨天不还是“娱乐至死”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "我记得是“及时行乐”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "......差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "想要绑架你这样的公子哥的罪犯不在少数，按我们的规矩，来一个打一个，就这么简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "——等等，怎么感觉屁股怪怪的，我完美的人体工程学沙发椅下是不是有什么东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯？我看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，好可爱的糖果盒，老板，你竟然在椅子下面偷藏零食！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "胡说，我怎么会蠢到把零食藏在这种——糖果盒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "就是糖果盒啊，上面还写着“维多利亚水果软糖”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "离远点能天使，那大概是个陷阱，别打开——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "唉，趴下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
